  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Let's check each option:\n\n1. ÷ and +\n\nGiven equation: 69 × 3 - 4 ÷ 5 + 6 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 69 × 3 - 4 + __**5 ÷ 6**__\n\n= __**69 × 3**__ - 4 + 0.83\n\n= __**207**__ - 4 __**+ 0.83**__\n\n= 207.83 - 4\n\n= 203.83 ≠ R.H.S\n\n2. × and +\n\nGiven equation: 69 × 3 - 4 ÷ 5 + 6 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 69 + 3 - __**4 ÷ 5**__ × 6\n\n= 69 + 3 - __**0.8 × 6**__\n\n= __**69 + 3**__ - 4.8\n\n= 72 - 4.8\n\n= 67.2 ≠ R.H.S\n\n3. + and -\n\nGiven equation: 69 × 3 - 4 ÷ 5 + 6 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 69 × 3 + __**4 ÷ 5**__ - 6\n\n= __**69 × 3**__ + 0.8 - 6\n\n= __**207 + 0.8**__ - 6\n\n= 207.8 - 6\n\n= 201.8 ≠ R.H.S\n\n4. × and ÷\n\nGiven equation: 69 × 3 - 4 ÷ 5 + 6 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\nL.H.S = __**69 ÷ 3**__ - 4 × 5 + 6\n\n= 23 - __**4 × 5**__ + 6\n\n= **23** - 20 __**+ 6**__\n\n= 29 - 20\n\n= 9 = R.H.S\n\nHence, ‘**× and ÷**’ is the correct answer.",
